    "display_name": "Finding Paradise",
    "long_instructions": "**\"A city\" and \"Somewhere far away\" aren’t very specific. More questions narrow it down.**\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n- Fix the `decide` function to help someone decide where their paradise might be:\r\n  - If they want people around and warm weather, they should look for \"A beach city.\"\r\n  - If they want people around but not warm weather, they should look for \"A big city.\"\r\n  - If they don’t want people around but do want warm weather, they should look for \"A remote island.\"\r\n  - If they don’t want people around and don’t want warm weather, they should look for \"A cabin in the mountains.\"\r\n- If you finish with time to spare, expand your decision tree with more questions.\r\n",
